  "summary": "Spring Framework Cross-site Scripting via EscapedErrors",
  "details": "Spring MVC and WebFlux applications that obtain a data-binding Errors instance with HTML escaping enabled and then render field errors using the no-argument `Errors.getFieldErrors()` or `Errors.getFieldError()` accessors are vulnerable to arbitrary HTML/JavaScript code injection, potentially resulting in a reflected cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability.",
